Upstream base
-------------

This editor is an experimental demo fork of the Hydra web editor
(https://github.com/hydra-synth/hydra) by Olivia Jack and contributors.
The fork retains Hydra's AGPL license and attribution history. The
companion engine bundle `/_engine/hydra-synth.js` is generated from this
repository's own sources (the Noisemaker-powered replacement for Hydra's
renderer) and carries the repository's AGPL license.

